
~ title

Mid-day

=> END


~ start

set EventManager.store("actions", 1)
set EventManager.store("eat_meal", false)
set EventManager.store("healed", false)
set EventManager.store("rested", false)

=> action


~ action

It is mid-day.
	[br]You have {{EventManager.temp.actions}} actions available.

- Eat meal (no actions used)
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.FOOD, 1) and EventManager.temp.eat_meal == false
		You eat some food.

		set EventManager.temp.eat_meal = true
		do Game.inventory.remove( Items.FOOD, 1 )
		do Game.player.apply_stat( StatType.HUNGER, 40 )
	else
		You have [if EventManager.temp.eat_meal]already eaten[else]no food[/if].
	
- Use Medicine (no actions used)
	if Game.inventory.has(Items.MEDICINE, 1) and EventManager.temp.healed == false
		You treat your wounds with the medicine.

		set EventManager.temp.healed = true
		do Game.inventory.remove( Items.MEDICINE, 1 )
		do Game.player.apply_stat( StatType.HEALTH, 25 )
	else
		You have [if EventManager.temp.healed]already used medicine[else]no medicine[/if].

- Rest (regain health)
	if EventManager.temp.rested == false
		% You [[take a break to|rest and]] [[recover|recuperate]].
		% You [[take a break to|rest and]] [[recover|recuperate]] your [[strength|wits]].
		#% You take a break to [[recover|recuperate]].
		#% You take a break to [[recover|recuperate]] your [[strength|wits]].
		#% You rest and [[recover|recuperate]].
		#% You rest and [[recover|recuperate]] your [[strength|wits]].

		set EventManager.temp.rested = true
		do EventManager.temp.actions -= 1
		do Game.skip_hour()
		do Game.player.apply_stat( StatType.HUNGER, -5 )
		do Game.player.apply_stat( StatType.HEALTH, 10 )
	else
		You have [if EventManager.temp.rested]already rested[else]no actions left[/if].

- Leave => END

=> action